{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["See also: ",["l","作物生长日历","Crop Growth Calendars"]]],["p",["Fertilizer is used to support ",["l","农作物","crop"]," and ",["l","树","tree"]," growth, assisting ",["l","耕种","farming"],". There are three types of crop fertilizer, affecting respectively crop quality, growth speed and water retention. There is only one tree fertilizer type, affecting growth speed. A fertilizer is used by placing it on tilled soil or the desired tree. Some crop fertilizers must be placed before the planted seed sprouts, the other fertilizers can be used at any time during plant growth. Each crop fertilizer type has three tiers, and the tree fertilizer has only one tier. Crop fertilizers affect all crops, including crops grown from ",["l","打造#Seeds","Wild Seeds"],"."]]]],["Mechanics",2,[["p",["All fertilizer can be ",["l","打造#Fertilizer","crafted"],". Recipes for first tier fertilizers are learned once the required level of ",["l","耕种#Farming Skill","Farming"]," or ",["l","采集#Foraging Skill","Foraging"]," skill is reached. Second tier recipes are learned once the required level of ",["l","耕种#Farming Skill","Farming"]," skill is reached. Third tier recipes are purchased on ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"],". First and second tier crop fertilizers can also be purchased at ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","Pierre's General Store"]," year-round, or at ",["l","绿洲","The Oasis"]," on specific ",["l","周循环","days of the week"],"."]],["p",["Only one type of fertilizer may be used per soil tile. Fertilizer remains in the soil all season. When the season changes, fertilizer normally disappears. However, there are two exceptions in which fertilizer will remain in the soil:"]],["l",0,[[1,["If a multi-season ",["l","农作物","crop"]," (i.e., ",["l","上古水果","Ancient Fruit"],", ",["l","咖啡豆","Coffee Bean"],", ",["l","玉米","Corn"],", ",["l","向日葵","Sunflower"],", or ",["l","小麦","Wheat"],") is planted in the fertilized tile, and the new season is one in which the crop grows, the fertilizer will remain."]],[1,["Fertilizer placed in the ",["l","温室","Greenhouse"]," will remain in the soil unless it is un-tilled by a pickaxe."]]]],["p",["Note that crop quality is determined at harvest time and not at planting time. Prior to 1.5, fertilizer used in the ",["l","温室","Greenhouse"]," on crops which would mature out of their normal growing season might disappear before harvest and have no effect."]],["p",["Speed-Gro affects only the growth and first harvest of a multi-harvest crop. Quality fertilizers (",["l","初级肥料","Basic Fertilizer"],", ",["l","高级肥料","Quality Fertilizer"],", and ",["l","顶级肥料","Deluxe Fertilizer"],") affect all harvests of a multi-harvest crop, but if the crop produces multiple fruits or vegetables per harvest only one of the items will have improved quality. For example, when a blueberry crop, planted with quality fertilizer, produces a second harvest, and three blueberries are harvested from it, then only one will have improved quality."]],["p",["Removing a crop with a ",["l","工具","Tool"]," like the ",["l","斧头","axe"]," does not remove the fertilizer. A second hit with a tool, such as a ",["l","十字镐","Pickaxe"]," is required to remove the fertilizer and make the tile fallow."]]]],["Types of Fertilizer",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["When to Use"]},{"h":1,"v":["Pierre's"]},{"h":1,"v":["Oasis"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"b":[["l",1,[[1,["Produced per Craft"]]]]]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]}],[[["f","Basic_Fertilizer.png",48]],[["l","初级肥料","Basic Fertilizer"]],["Improves soil quality a little, increasing your chance to grow quality crops. Mix into tilled soil."],["Before the seed sprouts"],["100g\n(Spring 15, Year 1+)"],[],["2g"],[["i","(O)92","Sap ×2"]],["1"],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 1"]],[[["f","Quality_Fertilizer.png",48]],[["l","高级肥料","Quality Fertilizer"]],["Improves soil quality, increasing your chance to grow quality crops. Mix into tilled soil."],["Before the seed sprouts"],["150g\n(Year 2+)"],[],["10g"],[["i","(O)92","Sap ×4"],["l","鱼","Fish ×1"]],["2"],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 9"]],[[["f","Deluxe_Fertilizer.png",48]],[["l","顶级肥料","Deluxe Fertilizer"]],["Greatly improves soil quality, increasing your chance to grow quality crops. Mix into tilled soil."],["Before or after planting"],[],[],["70g"],[["i","(O)337","Iridium Bar ×1"]," ",["i","(O)92","Sap ×40"]],["5"],[["l","齐先生的核桃房","Qi's Walnut Room"]," for ",["i","(O)858","Qi Gem ×20"]]],[[["f","Basic_Retaining_Soil.png",48]],[["l","初级保湿土壤","Basic Retaining Soil"]],["This soil has a chance of staying watered overnight. Mix into tilled soil."],["Before or after planting"],["100g\n(Spring 15, Year 1+)"],[],["4g"],[["i","(O)390","Stone ×2"]],["1"],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 4"]],[[["f","Quality_Retaining_Soil.png",48]],[["l","高级保湿土壤","Quality Retaining Soil"]],["This soil has a good chance of staying watered overnight. Mix into tilled soil."],["Before or after planting"],["150g\n(Year 2+)"],["200g\n(Saturday only)"],["5g"],[["i","(O)390","Stone ×3"],["i","(O)330","Clay ×1"]],["2"],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 7"]],[[["f","Deluxe_Retaining_Soil.png",48]],[["l","顶级保湿土壤","Deluxe Retaining Soil"]],["This soil has a 100% chance of staying watered overnight. Mix into tilled soil."],["Before or after planting"],[],[],["30g"],[["i","(O)390","Stone ×5"],["i","(O)771","Fiber ×3"],["i","(O)330","Clay ×1"]],["1"],[["f","Island_Trader_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","姜岛商人","Island Trader"]," for ",["i","(O)848","Cinder Shard ×50"]]],[[["f","Speed-Gro.png",48]],[["l","生长激素","Speed-Gro"]],["Stimulates leaf production. Guaranteed to increase growth rate by at least 10%. Mix into tilled soil.\nNote: Does not reduce time between harvests for multi-harvest crops."],["Before or after planting"],["100g\n(Spring 15, Year 1+)"],[],["20g"],[["i","(O)726","Pine Tar ×1"],["i","(O)Moss","Moss ×5"]],["5"],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 3"]],[[["f","Deluxe_Speed-Gro.png",48]],[["l","高级生长激素","Deluxe Speed-Gro"]],["Stimulates leaf production. Guaranteed to increase growth rate by at least 25%. Mix into tilled soil.\nNote: Does not reduce time between harvests for multi-harvest crops."],["Before or after planting"],["150g\n(Year 2+)"],["80g\n(Thursday only)"],["40g"],[["i","(O)725","Oak Resin ×1"],["i","(O)881","Bone Fragment ×5"]],["5"],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 8"]],[[["f","Hyper_Speed-Gro.png",48]],[["l","顶级生长激素","Hyper Speed-Gro"]],["Greatly stimulates leaf production. Guaranteed to increase growth rate by at least 33%. Mix into tilled soil.\nNote: Does not reduce time between harvests for multi-harvest crops."],["Before or after planting"],[],[],["70g"],[["i","(O)909","Radioactive Ore ×1"],["i","(O)881","Bone Fragment ×3"],["i","(O)768","Solar Essence ×1"]],["1"],[["l","齐先生的核桃房","Qi's Walnut Room"]," for ",["i","(O)858","Qi Gem ×30"]]],[[["f","Tree_Fertilizer.png",48]],[["l","树肥","Tree Fertilizer"]],["Sprinkle on a wild tree to ensure rapid growth, even in winter. Doesn't work on fruit trees."],["After planting on tree seeds and saplings"],["N/A"],[],["10g"],[["i","(O)771","Fiber ×5"],["i","(O)390","Stone ×5"]],["1"],[["f","Foraging_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","采集","Foraging"]," Level 7"]]]]]],["Crop Quality Ratios",2,[["p",["Note that quality is determined at the time of harvest, and not at the time of planting. For crops that produce multiples at harvest (i.e., ",["l","咖啡豆","Coffee Bean"],", ",["l","蓝莓","Blueberry"],", ",["l","蔓越莓","Cranberries"],"), ",["l","初级肥料","Basic"],", ",["l","高级肥料","Quality"],", and ",["l","顶级肥料","Deluxe"]," fertilizers affect only the first crop produced."]],["p",["For the complete formula, please see ",["l","耕种#Complete Formula 2","Farming"],"."]]]],["Normal soil",3,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":[["l","耕种#Farming Ski